<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="641dc5a9">Change influencer network members need to be sponsored and recognized by business leaders in order to be able to deliver
effective and credible messages around the transformation.</attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="82ef1664"></attribute>
<attribute name="usageGuidance" nodeId="35c4f001"></attribute>
<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="90790f5f">&lt;p&gt;
    Include stakeholders at all levels, geographies and business functions impacted by the change in the networks. The
    members of the networks should understand the details of the change and its impact so that they can effectively share
    this information with others.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Change influencer network members typically assist with the following:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Representing the change at meetings and delivering key messages to targeted audiences
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Conducting informal discussions with employees impacted by the change and gathering their feedback
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Encouraging peers to commit to supporting the change effort wherever possible
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Identifing any resistance patterns and addressing any concerns around the change
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
</Element>
